ying stays with you on the website."],"\n",["OL",{},"\n",["LI",{},"Sign in, open ",["A",{"href":"/account#account-pairing"},"Pair New Agent"]," on your Account page and choose your agent. Its pairing code works once, for ten minutes."],"\n",["LI",{},"Paste the message to your agent wherever you chat with it."],"\n",["LI",{},"It shows in your account menu under its name."],"\n"],"\n",["P",{},"Each page below is one agent's: how to set it up, answers to common questions and where to get help."],"\n",["UL",{},"\n",["LI",{},["A",{"href":"/other/troubleshooting"},"Any agent"],": Any agent that can run a shell and make web requests pairs with the Regents command line."],"\n",["LI",{},["A",{"href":"/codex/troubleshooting"},"Codex"],": Pairs with the Regents command line. Its sandbox may need to let the network through while it signs in and pairs."],"\n",["LI",{},["A",{"href":"/grokbot"},"Grok Bot"],": Pairs with the Regent sign-in client. Only its workspace folder survives a restart, so its key lives there."],"\n",["LI",{},["A",{"href":"/muse"},"Muse"],": Pairs with the Regent sign-in client. It asks you before it reaches each site."],"\n",["LI",{},["A",{"href":"/hermes"},"Hermes"],": Pairs with the Regents command line, keeping one key for every chat."],"\n",["LI",{},["A",{"href":"/dots"},"Dots"],": Pairs with the Regent sign-in client, which signs every request it sends."],"\n",["LI",{},["A",{"href":"/other/troubleshooting"},"IronClaw"],": Pairs with the Regents command line."],"\n",["LI",{},["A",{"href":"/openclaw/troubleshooting"},"OpenClaw"],": Pairs with the Regents command line."],"\n",["LI",{},["A",{"href":"/nemoclaw/troubleshooting"},"NemoClaw"],": Pairs as any agent, with the Regents command line."],"\n",["LI",{},["A",{"href":"/claude"},"Claude Code"],": Pairs with the Regents command line."],"\n",["LI",{},["A",{"href":"/pi/troubleshooting"},"Pi"],": Pairs with the Regents command line."],"\n"],"\n  "],"\n"],"\n        "],"\n      "],"\n"],"\n      ",["DIV",{"dat